</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 27, 2005 - 8:06 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Regarding the theories on the EXCRUCIATING MINUTEA of cereal histories: I think you&#39;re all &#34;FRUIT LOOPS&#34;! &#40;lol&#41;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
