<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5557"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Beck<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Beck<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 9:03 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I completely agree with Iq! I think there are no clues with the actual cereal box, nor do I think that the brick is a clue, he needed it to not blow over.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
