<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5576"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Maxgravis<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Maxgravis<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 12:11 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->He chose the Post Toaties for a reason and I do not think he will take credit for any crime he did not do, he will have proof of it or not say anything. He has to have committed several more murders than the WPD say. I wonder sometimes though, why he continues to send drop offs and letters to KAKE and WPD and not to someone else who would share more info about him, like catchbtk.com<!--/Text--></td></tr>
