</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Linnieskid<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 11:05 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Cold he be taunting  with the brick? <BR>Brick:  How appropriate, seems we are hitting the proverbial brick wall! <BR>Brick:  are we, and le being &#34;thick as a brick&#34;? <BR>Brick:  3 little &#34;pigs&#34; &#40;le&#41; I&#39;ll huff and Puff...the house of brick did not blow down <BR>Forgive the rambling-just brainstorming! <BR>All the same, I think it was just to hold the box in place<!--/Text--></td></tr>
