<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5934"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Brazilian<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Brazilian<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 11:20 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I agree with iq... I think we people try to find a meaning in every little detail and most of them are merely superficial. <BR> <BR>He got that box because of the T letter and maybe cuz he though it would give a &#34;cool layout&#34; for his drop. <BR> <BR>Also, I think the brick was merely to avoid the box to fly away because some veicule passing on the road.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
