<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6551"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lorenap<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lorenap<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 08, 2005 - 9:49 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Sjforcum there were two sightings of the box. The first was on the Thursday prior and the other was on Friday. That would make it as least six days. e. A woman on her way to and from work saw it Thursday and a gentleman taking his son to a friend&#39;s house saw it Friday.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
