<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6671"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Essevi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Essevi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 09, 2005 - 3:55 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Skov- thank you for all of the research that you continue to do, sometimes most thought provoking, you&#39;re never afraid to think outside the box. <BR> <BR>Now, I have a question to anyone who can answer. <BR>I find myself a bit confused about drop #8. I have seen pictures of 3 different locations and I&#39;m not sure which is correct, it would be nice if someone could kindly explain. <BR> <BR>1. The sign with the arrow <BR>2. The sign with the M <BR>3. The No Dumping Call 911 sign <!--/Text--></td></tr>
