<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7327"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lizzie<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lizzie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 14, 2005 - 9:48 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->did anyone mention yet that if S.killet was typed, the &#34;t&#34; and the &#34;r&#34; are next to each other on the keyboard:  <BR>S. Killer <BR>Serial Killer <BR>Cereal Killer<!--/Text--></td></tr>
